flowchart TD
    A{Scope operation}

    A -->|Create rule| B[POST /api/scope-validation/]
    B --> C[Pydantic validates project, rule type, value and inclusion flag]
    C -->|Invalid| D[Return 422 validation error]
    C -->|Valid| E[Find project]
    E -->|Missing| F[Return 404 project not found]
    E -->|Found| G[Persist scope rule]
    G --> H[(scope_validations table)]
    H --> I[Return 201 scope rule]

    A -->|Check target| J[POST /api/scope-validation/check-target-scope]
    J --> K[Load active rules for project]
    K -->|No rules| L[Return out of scope with reason]
    K --> M[Match CIDR, range, domain, hostname or wildcard rules]
    M --> N{Matching exclusion?}
    N -->|Yes| O[Return is_in_scope false and blocking rules]
    N -->|No| P{Inclusive rule matches?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Return is_in_scope true and matching rules]
    P -->|No| O

    R[Scan execution] --> S[Calls the same scope-check use case]
    S -->|Out of scope| T[Mark scan failed and return 403]
    S -->|In scope| U[Permit bounded Nmap execution]
